    </title>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Status of Implementation Progress: 1. Mostly achieved. LGD had given specific responsibilities to Urban Development Wing-1 with necessary staffs to support &apos;Urban Primary Health Care Services Delivery Project-Phase II . Out of the designed manpower structure of the unit, one Administrative Officer and One Sr. Asst Secretary have been posted. LGD has established primary health care budget line and allocated PHC budget to ULBs. ULBs have submitted organograms to LGD for HR requirement for PHC. All project ULBs have functioning health departments, only Chattogram CC health department is fully staffed. MOUs signed with 4 ULBs in 5 PAs. Gender-responsive data collection on-going. 2. Urban PHC services are provided in 45 partnership areas and target the poor, women and children. Construction of 3 CRHCCs and 6 PHCCs on-going. 3. PMU from the original project is in place and is headed by a full-time Project Director. Total 14 individual consultants have been recruited and mobilized. FMIS is in place and PAs are generating automated financial statement.</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
